{"about_the_game":"Put your management skills to the demanding test and <strong>prove yourself as a fine ruler of the ancient Greek city</strong>. Throughout your journey, you will face many challenges, unexpected events, and promising opportunities. Make world-shaping decisions, command your subjects, erect magnificent structures, and make your Polis the most glorious place in the whole ancient world!<strong> Builders of Greece: Prologue</strong>, being a shortened version of the full game, is a great way to practice your management skills and learn basic game mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dozens of varied buildings<br></li><li>Extensive management and decision-making system<br></li><li>Random events and weather conditions<br></li><li>Trading, politics, and war systems<br></li><li>Old-school City Builder gameplay with a modern twist</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/82c3ab4980350b56ed7c32d78f8e6902.webp?t=1771358189\" width=600 height=11 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/2c2bba73b02e5b479ed341d96570782d.webp?t=1771358189\" width=617 height=63 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/6ad62b85481caf421c9a0d20ed195cc8.poster.avif?t=1771358189\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/6ad62b85481caf421c9a0d20ed195cc8.webm?t=1771358189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/6ad62b85481caf421c9a0d20ed195cc8.mp4?t=1771358189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Plan out your Polis with great precision - work out your own meticulously detailed city layout and establish unabated production chains. Choose from <strong>dozens of varied buildings </strong>at your disposal and decide which of them will best serve your loyal subjects. Maintain a balance between residential zones, administrative institutions, workshops, service buildings, and military facilities to provide your city with stable, dynamic development.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/82c3ab4980350b56ed7c32d78f8e6902.webp?t=1771358189\" width=600 height=11 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/8f3ee3f4a9bfa16d30657a4e23ed75f0.webp?t=1771358189\" width=617 height=63 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/91c846689f1cd921471d156e87333e7c.poster.avif?t=1771358189\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/91c846689f1cd921471d156e87333e7c.webm?t=1771358189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/91c846689f1cd921471d156e87333e7c.mp4?t=1771358189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Make fateful decisions and manage all the aspects of your city's life. Set your taxes, establish new trade routes, occupy resource-rich terrains, increase the population of your empire, react to unpredictable events, or become a local military power. <strong>The way you rule is entirely up to you!</strong> Take good care of your citizens' needs, guarantee their safety and secure their well-being. If you fail, your Polis will soon be hit by riots, plagues, or rapid emigration.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/82c3ab4980350b56ed7c32d78f8e6902.webp?t=1771358189\" width=600 height=11 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/dadf351e118929e08b905aa8626723d2.webp?t=1771358189\" width=617 height=63 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/fe3f087907e9dae0d757f497cc6cd12e.poster.avif?t=1771358189\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/fe3f087907e9dae0d757f497cc6cd12e.webm?t=1771358189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/fe3f087907e9dae0d757f497cc6cd12e.mp4?t=1771358189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Only a good, wise politics will encourage the local population to settle in your city. Prove as an efficient ruler and turn your small provincial town into a <strong>huge metropolis</strong> known throughout the whole glorious Greece! If you succeed, your city will become famous for its elite, top class society, astonishing wealth, magnificent buildings, and superb military power. Be careful though... your rivals will not remain idle!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/82c3ab4980350b56ed7c32d78f8e6902.webp?t=1771358189\" width=600 height=11 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/502546904be4f0ab61b278c1da9b0d5f.webp?t=1771358189\" width=617 height=63 /></span><br><br>Be sure to join our Discord server, where we regularly hold engaging events and competitions, and talk about the future of Builders of Greece with our beloved community. Know, that we are always happy to hear your thoughts, feedback and suggestions! Stay up to date, follow our Social Media channels, subscribe the YouTube channel and become part of our ancient society!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/e373eb791d612d514ec1230f8736d7ba.poster.avif?t=1771358189\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/e373eb791d612d514ec1230f8736d7ba.webm?t=1771358189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/e373eb791d612d514ec1230f8736d7ba.mp4?t=1771358189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add Builders of Greece to your Wishlist!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2147110?t=1771358189","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2147110?t=1771358189","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771358189","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771358189","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>EA Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/f2dbaaf602d8fd9c21c0acd52bb96571.avif?t=1771358189\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras_big/f2dbaaf602d8fd9c21c0acd52bb96571.avif?t=1771358189 width=800 height=450 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Put your management skills to the demanding test and <strong>prove yourself as a fine ruler of the ancient Greek city</strong>. Throughout your journey, you will face many challenges, unexpected events, and promising opportunities. Make world-shaping decisions, command your subjects, erect magnificent structures, and make your Polis the most glorious place in the whole ancient world!<strong> Builders of Greece: Prologue</strong>, being a shortened version of the full game, is a great way to practice your management skills and learn basic game mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dozens of varied buildings<br></li><li>Extensive management and decision-making system<br></li><li>Random events and weather conditions<br></li><li>Trading, politics, and war systems<br></li><li>Old-school City Builder gameplay with a modern twist</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/82c3ab4980350b56ed7c32d78f8e6902.webp?t=1771358189\" width=600 height=11 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/2c2bba73b02e5b479ed341d96570782d.webp?t=1771358189\" width=617 height=63 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/6ad62b85481caf421c9a0d20ed195cc8.poster.avif?t=1771358189\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/6ad62b85481caf421c9a0d20ed195cc8.webm?t=1771358189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/6ad62b85481caf421c9a0d20ed195cc8.mp4?t=1771358189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Plan out your Polis with great precision - work out your own meticulously detailed city layout and establish unabated production chains. Choose from <strong>dozens of varied buildings </strong>at your disposal and decide which of them will best serve your loyal subjects. Maintain a balance between residential zones, administrative institutions, workshops, service buildings, and military facilities to provide your city with stable, dynamic development.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/82c3ab4980350b56ed7c32d78f8e6902.webp?t=1771358189\" width=600 height=11 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/8f3ee3f4a9bfa16d30657a4e23ed75f0.webp?t=1771358189\" width=617 height=63 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/91c846689f1cd921471d156e87333e7c.poster.avif?t=1771358189\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/91c846689f1cd921471d156e87333e7c.webm?t=1771358189\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2147110/extras/91c846689f1cd921471d156e87333e7c.mp4?t=1771358189\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Make fateful decisions and manage all the aspects of your city's life. Set your taxes, establish new trade routes, occupy resource-rich terrains, increase the population of your empire, react to unpredictable events, or become a local military power. <strong>The way you rule is entirely up to you!</strong> Take good care of your citizens' needs, guarantee their safety and secure their well-being. If you fail, your Polis will soon be h